OL,3,AMusk says any limits on Ukraine's
OL,4,AStarlink access down to US, not his
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FElon Musk has suggested that the US
OL,8,Fgovernment may be behind restrictions
OL,9,Fon the speed at which some of Ukraine's
OL,10,Fweapons can travel and stay connected
OL,11,Fto SpaceX's Starlink internet network.
OL,13,FStarlink is a vital tool allowing Kyiv
OL,14,Fto guide drones to Russian targets and
OL,15,Falso protect its own skies, but on
OL,16,FTuesday night Ukraine said unexpected
OL,17,Fnew speed limits were disrupting its
OL,18,Fbattlefield missions.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
