OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMusk says any limits on Ukraine's
OL,4,AStarlink access down to US, not his
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn adviser to President Volodymyr
OL,8,FZelensky said he believed the
OL,9,Frestrictions were not a coincidence and
OL,10,Fwere related to the latest strains
OL,11,Fbetween Kyiv and Washington.
OL,13,FMusk said that Starshield, the
OL,14,Fmilitary-grade sister service to
OL,15,FStarlink, is controlled by the US
OL,16,Fgovernment, and "any limits on speed or
OL,17,Fusage are decided by the US military
OL,18,Fand ultimately [the US president]".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
